						 <blockquote> <p><strong>Home Wiki:</strong> <a href="http://scp-es.com/">La Fundación SCP/Spanish-Speaking Branch</a><br /> <strong>Original Article:</strong> <a href="http://scp-es.com/scp-es-122">SCP-ES-122: verdeVerduzcoVeraniego v1.0.1</a><br /> <strong>Original Author:</strong> <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lazylasagne" >LazyLasagne</a></span><br /> <strong>Translator:</strong> <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span><br /> <strong>Editor(s):</strong> <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span>, <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/almarduk" >Almarduk</a></span></p> </blockquote> <p>I had a good time translating this interesting article!</p> <p>From the original author:</p> <blockquote> <p>Simple idea and without much depth, only came through an interconnection (I wonder if swapping sounds better) of the memes &quot;Maximus&quot;, &quot;Plant&quot; and &quot;GRADIOSISIMO GOD GREEN, PRAISE BE&quot;, I say, &quot;Great Green God.&quot; Now you fly, buds.</p> <p>Remember, a shot of formaldehyde for every footnote!</p> </blockquote> 
